## Summary

Gazebo provides a comprehensive simulation environment for humanoid robotics with:

- Accurate physics simulation with multiple engine options
- Extensive sensor and actuator plugin support
- Seamless ROS 2 integration
- High-quality visualization and rendering
- Flexible world and model definition formats
- Realistic sensor simulation with noise models

Proper configuration of Gazebo with realistic physics parameters and sensor models enables effective development and testing of humanoid robot algorithms before deployment on real hardware.

